{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A typical family vacation, a modest American hotel, tense silence after yet another argument with your wife. It's okay, a glass of whiskey will smooth things over\u2014just one, to relax. But the day passes unnoticed. Evening falls. <i>Strange\u2026 where is everyone?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/BLUEMAN_GIF_04_Compressed.gif?t=1741534255\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Dangerous Place</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is madness! Everything is trying to kill you... You no longer remember how much time has passed\u2014hours, days\u2026 or maybe weeks? You're still searching for a way out. But what if there never was one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/BLUEMAN_GIF_01_Compressed.gif?t=1741534255\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do you truly believe you can escape?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;This place tests your limits, and only the strongest will find a way out.&quot;</i>\u00a0\u2014 it sounds like a cheap reality show slogan. But there are no spectators here, no applause. There's only silence, creaking floorboards, and the feeling that you're being watched. The truth is more straightforward: you're trapped here. And you're going to die here. The only question is how soon\u2026 and who (or what) will reach you first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/BLUEMAN_GIF_02_Compressed.gif?t=1741534255\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features of Our Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's no health bar to tell you how much time you have left, and no sanity meter to warn you when you're about to lose yourself. There's no weapon, no inventory, nothing you can cling to in your trembling hand in hopes of salvation. There's only you, endless corridors, and <i>something</i> that's always close\u2026 even if you can't hear its footsteps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/BLUEMAN_GIF_03_Compressed.gif?t=1741534255\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Important</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As developers, we've put a lot of effort into creating something new and unusual in the horror genre. We hope we can surprise you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3135260?t=1741534255","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3135260?t=1741534255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/5458d02d1e48cc9673bd90ca419dd1c73cf9d0a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741534255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/5458d02d1e48cc9673bd90ca419dd1c73cf9d0a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741534255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A typical family vacation, a modest American hotel, tense silence after yet another argument with your wife. It's okay, a glass of whiskey will smooth things over\u2014just one, to relax. But the day passes unnoticed. Evening falls. <i>Strange\u2026 where is everyone?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135260/extras/BLUEMAN_GIF_04_Compressed.gif?t=1741534255\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Dangerous Place</str